  {
    "tokenName": "border/focus",
    "collection": "Colour",
    "field": "description",
    "oldValue": "Keyboard focus ring on every interactive element — 2px weight at 2px OFFSET. The offset is load-bearing, not decorative: it lifts the ring off the control so the ring's neighbouring colour is always the page background (6.02:1, passes WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.11 at 3:1). Flush against a brand-filled surface it drops to 1.0:1 and disappears, because this token and surface/action both alias ocean/700. Implement as outline: 2px solid + outline-offset: 2px. Never removable, never flush.",
    "newValue": "Keyboard focus ring on every interactive element — 2px weight at 2px OFFSET. The offset is load-bearing, not decorative: it lifts the ring off the control so the ring's neighbouring colour is always the page background (6.02:1, passes WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.11 at 3:1). Flush against a brand-filled surface it drops to 1.0:1 and disappears, because this token and surface/action both alias ocean/700. Implement as outline: 2px solid + outline-offset: 2px. Never removable, never flush. Also the Nav Link active-state underline (2px), chosen over surface/brand because it holds contrast in both colour modes.",
    "date": "2026-09-29",
    "status": "changed"
  },
